5,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hello everyone! Let's all do our best to find the werewolf together. I'm so excited to get to know you all while we play!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... hello. I'm not very good at this, but I'll try my best. I hope we can all get along.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,Let's keep this logical. We need a system to track claims and contradictions. Emotional appeals won't help us find the wolf.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"Now, now, Asuka dear. Logic is important, but let's remember to be kind to one another. A warm heart often sees the truth.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Shizue-san. Let's try to maintain harmony. If we trust each other, it might be easier to spot something that feels wrong.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"That's right! Trust is key! @Asuka, maybe we can combine your logic with our intuition?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. I'll probably just follow what the rest of you think is right.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"Intuition is just a pattern the brain recognizes subconsciously. If we can articulate those patterns, then yes, it is useful.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,See? We are already finding common ground. I'm sure we can handle this together.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,"It's a bit scary knowing there's a werewolf among us, but I believe in this group.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Yumi,,I wonder who the Seer is! They have such a big responsibility. I hope they can find the wolf quickly!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,I hope the Seer is safe... I don't want anyone to get hurt.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,The Seer should be careful about when they reveal themselves. Doing it too early makes them a target.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"That is a very sensible point, Asuka. We must protect those who help us.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,"I'll listen carefully to everyone's tone. Sometimes the truth is in how someone says something, not just what they say.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Yumi,,I'm ready for the first night! Let's all sleep well and hope for good news tomorrow!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,Okay... goodnight everyone.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""norm"":[{""code"":""pass_punct"",""token"":""Over"",""raw"":""Over.""}],""raw"":""Over.""}"
23,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"Sweet dreams, everyone. May we wake up to a peaceful morning.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Midori,,Goodnight. Let's stay positive!,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
