31,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Everyone, listen! I'm the Seer, and I checked Asuka last night. She is the werewolf! We found her already!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"What? Really? Asuka-san... I can't believe it. Are you sure, Yumi-san?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"That is a very bold claim. Yumi, you're claiming to be the Seer just to frame me? That's a classic werewolf tactic.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh my. This is quite a shock. Yumi-chan seems so sincere, but Asuka-san is usually so composed.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,"This is a difficult start. Yumi-san, are you absolutely certain? It's a very heavy accusation to make so early.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I am 100% sure! The divination was clear. Asuka is the werewolf! We have to vote her out now!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I don't know who to believe. Yumi-san is so energetic, but Asuka-san is so logical...","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"Exactly. Think about it. If I were the wolf, would I really be this obvious? Yumi is trying to force a quick execution to end the game.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Asuka-san, you sound very calm, but Yumi-chan's voice is trembling with conviction. I feel she is telling the truth.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I want to believe in harmony, but the Seer's information is our only real lead. @Daisuke, what do you think?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"Please, everyone! Trust me! If we let the werewolf stay, more of us will be attacked tonight!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think I trust Yumi-san. She's always been so honest. I'm sorry, Asuka-san.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"This is irrational. You're basing your decision on ""feelings"" and ""energy"" rather than evidence. I am a human.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"Sometimes the heart provides the evidence that the mind misses, dear. I'm leaning toward Yumi-chan.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,"If the majority feels Yumi-san is the Seer, it's the safest bet for the village. I'm sorry, Asuka-san, but the logic of the Seer's role is strong.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Yumi,,Thank you everyone! Let's vote for Asuka and save our village!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,Okay. I'll vote with everyone else.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Asuka,,You are making a grave mistake. You'll regret this when you realize you've killed a villager.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I hope for all our sakes that we are doing the right thing.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,Let's proceed with the vote.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
